=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# logs screen-unreadable ---------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: the Logs screen. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13, less$
# installed. /var/log/hardn.log is a directory. Root reads past$
# a file's permissions [I], so a directory or an I/O error is$
# what is left of "unreadable".$
$
# Logs #########################################################$
$
# Log ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  File                 /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  Can't read it: is a directory$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Refresh              Read the log again$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

